    "items": [
      {
        "type": "heading2",
        "verse_numbers": [],
        "lines": [
          "Psalm 2"
        ],
        "rlw_lines": []
      },
      {
        "type": "heading1",
        "verse_numbers": [],
        "lines": [
          "The Reign of the Lord’s Anointed."
        ],
        "rlw_lines": []
      },
      {
        "type": "verse",
        "verse_numbers": [
          1
        ],
        "lines": [
          "Why are the nations restless",
          "And the peoples plotting in vain?"
        ],
        "rlw_lines": []
      },
      {
        "type": "verse",
        "verse_numbers": [
          2
        ],
        "lines": [
          "The kings of the earth take their stand",
          "And the rulers conspire together",
          "Against the Lord and against His Anointed, saying,"
        ],
        "rlw_lines": []
      },
      {
        "type": "verse",
        "verse_numbers": [
          3
        ],
        "lines": [
          "“Let’s tear their shackles apart",
          "And throw their ropes away from us!”"
        ],
        "rlw_lines": []
      },
      {
        "type": "verse",
        "verse_numbers": [
          4
        ],
        "lines": [
          "¶He who sits in the heavens laughs,",
          "The Lord scoffs at them."
        ],
        "rlw_lines": []
      },
      {
        "type": "verse",
        "verse_numbers": [
          5
        ],
        "lines": [
          "Then He will speak to them in His anger",
          "And terrify them in His fury, saying,"
        ],
        "rlw_lines": []
      },
      {
        "type": "verse",
        "verse_numbers": [
          6
        ],
        "lines": [
          "“But as for Me, I have installed My King",
          "Upon Zion, My holy mountain.”"
        ],
        "rlw_lines": []
      },
      {
        "type": "verse",
        "verse_numbers": [
          7
        ],
        "lines": [
          "¶“I will announce the decree of the Lord:",
          "He said to Me, ‘You are My Son,",
          "Today I have fathered You."
        ],
        "rlw_lines": []
      },
      {
        "type": "verse",
        "verse_numbers": [
          8
        ],
        "lines": [
          "‘Ask it of Me, and I will certainly give the nations as Your inheritance,",
          "And the ends of the earth as Your possession."
        ],
        "rlw_lines": []
      },
      {
        "type": "verse",
        "verse_numbers": [
          9
        ],
        "lines": [
          "‘You shall break them with a rod of iron,",
          "You shall shatter them like earthenware.’ ”"
        ],
        "rlw_lines": []
      },
      {
        "type": "verse",
        "verse_numbers": [
          10
        ],
        "lines": [
          "¶Now then, you kings, use insight;",
          "Let yourselves be instructed, you judges of the earth."
        ],
        "rlw_lines": []
      },
      {
        "type": "verse",
        "verse_numbers": [
          11
        ],
        "lines": [
          "Serve the Lord with reverence",
          "And rejoice with trembling."
        ],
        "rlw_lines": []
      },
      {
        "type": "verse",
        "verse_numbers": [
          12
        ],
        "lines": [
          "Kiss the Son, that He not be angry and you perish on the way,",
          "For His wrath may be kindled quickly.",
          "How blessed are all who take refuge in Him!"
        ],
        "rlw_lines": []
      }
    ]
  },
